- "ClassName" / "ClassName.methodName" - Class or scoped method (1 level nesting only)
- "ClassName.end" - End of class (max depth: OuterClass.InnerClass.end)
- "start" / "end" - File positions (insert_node ONLY, "start" inserts after file headers: shebang, comments, docstrings, package declarations, and imports)
