- Object literals: Unscoped names only, no .end selector
- replace_in_node: old_str must be unique and minimal
- PARALLEL CALLS: Invoke multiple times simultaneously for independent edits
- delete_node doesn't check references - verify before deleting

FALLBACK (use old_str/new_str instead of operation/selector):
- Arrow function class properties: class Foo { bar = () => {} }
